        "text": "Petitioner argues that \u00a7\u202f1956 requires an intent to minimize the criminal taint of unlawful proceeds, not a requirement to conceal the money\u2019s existence, and that his conduct did not conceal the nature, source, location, ownership or control of the proceeds."
      },
