            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to MS. SCHERTLER, the United States contends that the phrase \u201cdesigned in whole or in part\u201d calls for a full examination of the plan for cross\u2011border transportation of known illegal proceeds, and that the statute\u2019s purpose is to prevent criminals from moving proceeds abroad to evade U.S. controls."
